{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23361","headline":"寄崔少监 · 白居易","name":"寄崔少监","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微微西风生，稍稍东方明。\n入秋神骨爽，琴晓丝桐清。\n弹爲古宫调，玉水寒泠泠。\n自觉弦指下，不是寻常声。\n须臾羣动息，掩琴坐空庭。\n直至日出後，犹得心和平。\n惜哉意未已，不使崔君听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}